subckt dut (VDD VSS Vinp Vinn Voutp Voutn)
ISS (net1 VSS) isource dc=1m
M1 (net2 Vinp net1 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M2 (net3 Vinn net1 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M3 (net2 net0 VDD VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M4 (net3 net0 VDD VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M5 (Voutp net2 VDD VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M6 (Voutn net3 VDD VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M7 (Voutp net4 VSS VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M8 (Voutn net4 VSS VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
R1 (net2 net0) resistor r=1k
R2 (net0 net3) resistor r=1k
R3 (net4 Voutp) resistor r=1k
R4 (Voutn net4) resistor r=1k
